---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Volunteering & Community Partners | Iowa CYP
description: Meet Iowa CYP’s community partners and explore volunteer opportunities and resources for Iowa National Guard families.
permalink: /support/index.html
---
{% set photoNeedsList = photoNeeds() %}
<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden" data-reveal>
  {% set heroPhoto = requestPhoto({
    id: "support-hero-fall-family-festival",
    allowRepeat: true,
    strict: true,
    context: page.url ~ "#hero",
    note: "Support hero background"
  }) %}
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img
      src="{{ heroPhoto.src }}"
      alt="{{ heroPhoto.alt }}"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_15%]"
      {{ imageAttrs(heroPhoto.src) | safe }}
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async"
    >
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/35"></div>
  <div class="relative container min-h-[60vh] py-24 flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/88 p-6 md:p-10 text-white text-center space-y-6 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary">IOWA CYP SUPPORT</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-white">COMMUNITY SUPPORT FOR IOWA GUARD FAMILIES</h1>
      <p class="text-white/95 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">Help at a camp or family event, find resources for your school, or talk with us about working together.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a class="hero-cta" href="#community-partners">Meet our community partners</a>
        <a class="hero-cta-secondary" href="#volunteers">Volunteer with us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="container grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><polyline points="7 13 12 18 17 13"></polyline><polyline points="7 6 12 11 17 6"></polyline></svg>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Community Partners</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">See how local organizations have helped bring camps, family events, and other activities to Guard-connected youth.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="#community-partners">Meet the partners</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Support Military-Connected Students</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">See what your school already does to support military-connected students and what it takes to earn Purple Star recognition.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="/educators/">Explore the Purple Star guide</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Celebrate Together</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Host Purple Up moments, share social graphics, and join statewide Month of the Military Child events.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="/month-of-the-military-child/">Plan your celebration</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"></polygon></svg>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Volunteer Your Time</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Welcome campers, help set up an event, or support a youth activity.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="#volunteers">Find your fit</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="community-partners" class="bg-white py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary/70">Community partners</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Organizations that have supported Iowa Guard families</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Local businesses, nonprofits, veterans organizations, and universities have helped Iowa CYP offer camps, activities, and events where Guard families can connect.</p>
      <blockquote class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-primary/5 p-5 text-sm italic text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        “They do a great job hosting free events for military families. We love it. My husband has attended several events while I’ve been deployed, and it helped him connect with other military families.”
        <span class="mt-3 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/70 not-italic">Military family feedback</span>
      </blockquote>
      <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Have an idea for working together to serve Iowa Guard families?</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/contact/#general-contact">Contact the CYP team</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4">
      {% for partner in partners.items %}
        <article class="content-card flex flex-col gap-4 text-center h-full" data-reveal data-interactive="true">
          {% if partner.logo %}
            <img src="{{ partner.logo }}" alt="{{ partner.name }} logo" class="{% if partner.id == 'PR001' %}h-20{% else %}h-16{% endif %} object-contain mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          {% endif %}
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ partner.name }}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">{{ partner.description }}</p>
          </div>
          {% if partner.website %}
            <a class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mt-auto" href="{{ partner.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit website</a>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="educators-stp" class="bg-primary/5 py-20" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-10">
    <div class="relative isolate flex min-h-[30rem] items-end overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-slate-950 md:items-center md:justify-end">
      <img
        src="/assets/img/support-schools-and-teens.jpg"
        alt="A speaker addresses an audience from a podium bearing the Iowa state seal"
        class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_25%]"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-slate-950/45 to-transparent md:bg-gradient-to-l md:from-slate-950/80 md:via-slate-950/45 md:to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="max-w-xl space-y-3 p-6 text-white md:p-12">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary">For schools and teens</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-3xl">Find the right place to start</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-white">Schools can find classroom resources and Purple Star guidance. Guard-connected teens can learn what it takes to join the State Teen Panel.</p>
        <blockquote class="rounded-3xl border border-white/20 bg-slate-950/50 p-5 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-white">
          “They did a great job bringing some normalcy to the kiddos.”
          <span class="mt-3 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/90 not-italic">Educator and family feedback</span>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="content-card flex flex-col gap-6 h-full" data-reveal data-interactive="true">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">Educators</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">Use the four Purple Star requirements to build on what your school already does for military-connected students.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Guidance on naming a school liaison and linking to family resources</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Purple Up ideas and classroom kits</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Staff training options that can earn educators CEUs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a class="btn mt-auto w-fit" href="/educators/">Explore the Purple Star guide</a>
      </article>

      <article class="content-card flex flex-col gap-6 h-full" data-reveal data-interactive="true">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">State Teen Panel</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">STP is Iowa CYP's teen leadership program for Guard-connected youth ages 13–17. Plan events, advise programs, and represent Iowa at regional symposiums.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Lead service projects and mentor younger campers</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Earn volunteer hours and leadership experience</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Connect with teens who understand military life</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a class="btn mt-auto w-fit" href="/state-teen-panel/">Learn About STP</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="momc" class="bg-white py-20" data-reveal>
  <div class="container">
    {% set momcTeaserPhoto = requestPhoto({
      id: "support-family-event-dance",
      allowRepeat: true,
      strict: true,
      context: page.url ~ "#momc",
      note: "MOMC teaser photo"
    }) %}
    <div class="relative isolate flex min-h-[30rem] items-end overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-slate-950 md:items-center">
      <img
        src="{{ momcTeaserPhoto.src }}"
        alt="{{ momcTeaserPhoto.alt }}"
        class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 h-full w-full object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-slate-950/45 to-transparent md:bg-gradient-to-r" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="max-w-xl space-y-5 p-6 text-white md:p-12">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary">Month of the Military Child</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-white">A statewide April celebration for military kids</h2>
        <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">Purple Up, classroom kits, and family events all live on our dedicated Month of the Military Child page. Start there if you want the full calendar, resources, and ways to participate.</p>
        <blockquote class="rounded-3xl border border-white/20 bg-slate-950/50 p-5 text-sm italic text-white leading-relaxed">
          “Our kids thought it was so special to attend the family ball last year with other military kids while their mom was deployed. It helped them realize they weren’t the only kids with a parent who was deployed or away at times.”
          <span class="mt-3 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/90 not-italic">Military Family Ball feedback</span>
        </blockquote>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a class="hero-cta" href="/month-of-the-military-child/">Open MOMC page</a>
          <a class="hero-cta-secondary" href="{{ site.links.momcRequest }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Request a Classroom Kit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="volunteers" class="container py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    {% set volunteerPhoto = requestPhoto({
      id: "support-horse-camp-briefing",
      allowRepeat: true,
      strict: true,
      context: page.url ~ "#volunteers",
      note: "Volunteers and teen leaders photo"
    }) %}
    <div class="relative isolate flex min-h-[24rem] items-end overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-slate-950 md:items-center md:justify-end">
      <img
        src="{{ volunteerPhoto.src }}"
        alt="{{ volunteerPhoto.alt }}"
        class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_30%]"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-slate-950/45 to-transparent md:bg-gradient-to-l" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="max-w-xl space-y-3 p-6 text-white md:p-12">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary">Volunteers &amp; teen leaders</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Find your way to get involved</h2>
        <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">Give your time, help at events, or grow as a teen leader. Choose a path below and the CYP team will follow up about next steps.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid auto-rows-fr gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="content-card flex h-full flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Adult volunteers</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700">Help with events, activities, registration, supplies, and other program needs. Tell us your interests and availability through our adult volunteer form.</p>
        <a class="btn mt-auto w-full justify-center text-center" href="{{ site.links.volunteerInterest }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply as an adult volunteer</a>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card flex h-full flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Youth volunteers</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700">Volunteer at CYP events, support service projects, or help with STP activities. Military affiliation is not required, and you do not need to join STP.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">For youth under 18, subject to activity age requirements. Guardian consent, approval, orientation, and direct adult supervision are required.</p>
        <a class="btn mt-auto w-full justify-center text-center" href="/youth-volunteer-application/">Apply as a youth volunteer</a>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card flex h-full flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Official STP membership</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700">A leadership opportunity for eligible Guard-connected teens ages 13–17. Members plan events, advise CYP, and represent their peers through an ongoing commitment.</p>
        <a class="btn mt-auto w-full justify-center text-center" href="{{ site.links.stpApply }}">Apply to STP</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/70 p-6 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    Prefer to start with a quick question? Email us at <a class="font-semibold text-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a> or call your local Soldier &amp; Family Readiness Support Specialist—we’ll point you to the right shift.
  </div>
</section>
